{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46857","headline":"行次宜春寄湘西诸友 · 齐己","name":"行次宜春寄湘西诸友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幸无名利路相迷，双履寻山上柏梯。\n衣鉢祖辞梅岭外，香灯社别橘洲西。\n云中石壁青[侵]汉，树下苔钱绿遶溪。\n我爱远游君爱住，此心他约与谁携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}